  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>No one can escape you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Step Up<sup>CRB</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever an adjacent foe attempts to move away from you, you may move up to your movement rate as an immediate action so long as you end up adjacent to the foe that triggered this ability. If you move more than 1/2 your movement rate, you may only take a move or standard action on your next turn.</p>\n<p>If you expend a use of mythic power, you may move up to twice your movement rate to follow an adjacent foe, and still take a full action on your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc98\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
